# Git commit messages — no Cursor co-author

- **Never** append `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor agent co-author line) to commit messages.
- When creating commits via `git commit`, do not use `--trailer` or HEREDOC footers that add this line.
- Project hook `.githooks/commit-msg` strips this trailer if present; agents must not rely on that and must omit it at source.
